    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Games:</strong> Attract gamers by offering a wide selection of popular titles and keep them coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and Furnish Your Cafe:</strong> Customize your cafe with a variety of furniture, decorations, and computer setups. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain a Clean Cafe:</strong> A clean cafe is a happy cafe. Stay on top of the mess,  and make sure your space remains inviting and professional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay Bills and Manage Finances:</strong> Balance your budget, pay your bills on time, and make smart investments to keep your cafe profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Satisfaction:</strong> Manage customer needs and expectations while keeping your cafe running smoothly.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Games:</strong> Attract gamers by offering a wide selection of popular titles and keep them coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and Furnish Your Cafe:</strong> Customize your cafe with a variety of furniture, decorations, and computer setups. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain a Clean Cafe:</strong> A clean cafe is a happy cafe. Stay on top of the mess,  and make sure your space remains inviting and professional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay Bills and Manage Finances:</strong> Balance your budget, pay your bills on time, and make smart investments to keep your cafe profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Satisfaction:</strong> Manage customer needs and expectations while keeping your cafe running smoothly.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
